      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Batch retru\nInput: batch number (form).\n\n1. Queues the ERROR/QUEUED tasks of the batch and retrieves their prompt.\n2. Replay them via Article Task Runner (each mode).\n3. Call Finalize Batch ONCE (once mode): Word + Telegram if complete, notification otherwise.\n\n\"Stainless\" branch: batch already complete or not found, Finalize Batch returns the appropriate file or message.",
